[Options]

[A.]

<h2>~lResidence of the Evil King</h2>
<i>"Final attack were tough"<br>
--Sunder</i>
<p>Now you attack the heart of Evil King's Kingdom - residence of the Evil King. Evil King dont afraid you and will fight against you and Klod with his guards. Good luck!
$Button=Its too hard for me!,Tell,Campaign
$Button=Procceed,DoNothing,0

[@1]

<h2>~lIncoming Message</h2>
<i>~jFrom: ~qGeneral Klod Jandor<br>
~jTo: ~qSunder</i>
<p>Finally we are here. Now we have all chances to beat him. Let's fight!

$Button=Accept,Tell,Evil

[Evil]

<h2>~lIncoming Message</h2>
<i>~jFrom: ~qEvil King<br>
~jTo: ~qSunder</i>
<p>Haha, little shit, you began to destroy my plans, so now you and your lillte shit helper will be eliminated from Nimbus forever. Prepare for a die!

$Button=Accept,DoNothing,0
$Button=Check your Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55

[Succeeded] [BadTeamDead]

<h2>~lCongratulations!</h2>
<i>"No more enemies I thought"<br>
--Sunder</i>
<p>Residence of the Evil King destroyed. Nimbians like you as a new King! But...

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,Donesh3_y_n_1a=0>
<$Config,Donesh3_y_n_2a=1>
